<title>INDIA: Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 5.71 pct in week.</title>
<headline>Indian yr/yr inflation rises to 5.71 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-09-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's year-on-year inflation rate measured by the wholesale price index rose to 5.71 percent in the week ending August 24 from 5.53 percent in the previous week, the Industry Ministry said on Sunday.</p>
<p>    WHOLESALE PRICES	Aug 24	 Aug 17     Aug 26, 1995</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change    +5.71	  +5.53	 +8.7</p>
<p>    Index (base=1981/82)  313.1	  312.7	 295.2</p>
<p>Note - Figures are preliminary except for those for week ended August 26, 1995.</p>
</text>
